{'symbol': 'FSLR', 'date': '2021-05-03 11:33:00', 'title': 'NEL ASA: ENTERS COLLABORATION WITH FIRST SOLAR', 'text': 'OSLO, NORWAY, MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NEL HYDROGEN ELECTROLYSER, A DIVISION OF NEL ASA (NEL)\xa0(OSE:NEL),\xa0HAS ENTERED A COLLABORATION WITH LEADING SOLAR COMPANY FIRST SOLAR, INC. (NASDAQ: FSLR), TO DEVELOP INTEGRATED PHOTO VOLTAIC (PV) HYDROGEN POWER PLANTS. "WE ARE VERY EXCITED TO ANNOUNCE THE COLLABORATION WITH FIRST SOLAR, A LEADING GLOBAL MANUFACTURER OF SOLAR PANELS AND DEVELOPER OF UTILITY-SCALE SOLAR POWER PLANTS.'}